exports[`Veronica ops tools, golden outputs keeps the system card text, with every shape of schedule described the same way 1`] = `
"What Ratingo runs (generated from its code)

Scheduled jobs (name: how often; what it does). Between its runs a weekly job normally shows no success for days:
- job-every-two-minutes: every two minutes; runs often
- job-every-twenty-minutes: every twenty minutes; runs every twenty minutes
- job-every-four-hours: every four hours; runs every four hours
- job-twice-a-day: twice a day; runs twice a day
- job-daily: daily; runs once a day
- job-daily-except-monday: daily except Monday; skips Monday
- job-weekly: weekly on Monday; runs weekly
- job-weekly-on-sunday: weekly on Sunday; runs on Sunday
- job-three-days-a-week: on Monday, Wednesday and Friday; runs on three days
- job-twice-on-saturday: twice a day on Saturday; runs twice on Saturday
- job-monthly: on a custom schedule; runs monthly

Queues:
- ingestion: syncs titles
- stats-queue: computes statistics

External APIs:
- api.themoviedb.org: titles and images
- api.trakt.tv: trending and ratings
- api.tvmaze.com: episode data"
`;

